  description: '"Fallen of Albaz" + 1 Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link Monster

    You
    can only control 1 "Mirrorjade the Iceblade Dragon". Once per turn (Quick Effect):
    You can send 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck to the GY that mentions "Fallen
    of Albaz" as material; banish 1 monster on the field, also this card cannot use
    this effect next turn. If this Fusion Summoned card in its owner''s control leaves
    the field because of an opponent''s card: You can destroy all monsters your opponent
    controls during the End Phase of this turn.'
